  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Four repositories, one chain",
      "items": [
        "studies says what to run and why; the dispatcher launches it; the wrapper trains it; the atlas shows the result",
        "Shared Hydra configs stay in the dispatcher; each study's exact sweep and experiment stay in its variant",
        "Beaker jobs re-pull the wrapper, dispatcher and foraging-models at the SHAs the launcher pinned"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Provenance at launch",
      "items": [
        "The launcher refuses a study directory with uncommitted changes, and a sweep on the live database",
        "Its launch record names the studies, dispatcher, wrapper and foraging-models SHAs, the data snapshot and the image",
        "Every W&B run carries meta.*: study, variant, launch_id, studies_commit and the note saying why it ran"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Reports are code",
      "items": [
        "Only a freeze reads W&B; producers compute from committed inputs, each keyed by its digest",
        "GRU, disRNN, baseline RL and HB all report heldout/eval_likelihood, so they share one axis",
        "The atlas rebuilds from studies main and traces every number back to its launch and commits"
      ]
    }
  ]
